    "body": "The recovered native model skips a Source fragment after its correct first factual fragment. The fitter disables an existing temporal Prefix-to-Context credit path. This change exposes that shared learning seam in a fixed18-frame offline discriminator, verifies both modes against the same authenticated native forwards, saves two weighted Context gradient arms, and evaluates one prospectively ranked adjacent native Context code.\n\nThe independent audit verifies changed credit in3,840 self-transition,3,840 neighbor-transition and23,115 token-transition scalars. Root/category gradients are unchanged. TotalON ranking selects self_category[413], whose OFF/ON dots are equal. Its nativecode1→2 changes category/code observations onall18 frames while leaving retained Context states, bank scores, bridge/U/Generate/Copy vectors, full pools and the combinedCE4.391651926613631 unchanged;17 reference winners are retained. This establishes connected conditional temporal credit and a bounded negative for the selected inherited-category move. The parent is restored and no model is selected.\n\nValidation at executed92215de1ef497dcab477b193ea6964c1137832b8: actual69 exampletests, releaseCUDA build andformat PASS; mathematical/adversarial exact-source reviews PASS. Binaryacfe7950313626108f8ff9cfc71980b30ac6faec34ec30b98523ab95e67b2eec/configc7478501e4307d939004d21f1b048905d22831eb953d348f68aba612e39f844e. All18 OFF/ON forwards pass before either backward arm. Independent readerc8681bfc audits all9 rawfamilies/missing/f32differences, all17,472 proposedbasis coordinates/BOTHdots, one packedcode/frozenpayload/dependent bindings and18 bridge/G/U/physicalalias pools. Allfour Rustcomplete-file verifications PASS. Model40.122138s/RSS1,393,276KiB; saved audit793.808445s, including networkIO, separately charged.\n\nRuntimeprivate9eeb1d399c0480dbde17dff13b71ed85cb64b8b5 and completeprivate7a3bf149c64a8e6ba77bcb70a11086b76387135d freshly verified; fullresult204,338,578B/122files, compressedarchive26,939,483B. Source/result/checks/configs/raw gradients/finite artifact and audit are retained. The structured evidence and current-state entry preserve scope and next causal question. Finaldeliveryhead e2725604995f99b2aac468fae8dee573587a6677 preserves concurrentmain dialogue work and unchanged executed probe source; actual finalhead 69 example tests, format and release CUDA build PASS (job 20261008T182709Z; CHECKS_PASS, exit 0). Final exact-head source/evidence review PASS. Final build-only binary 23821562c538be2602434b3408d168cdfc924bf6165123ae8691f6b95af4d65b differs from the measured 92215de binary; no model rerun or new behavior claim.\n\nServing receives no case/cursor/Source filter. Full-prefix/original-eight EOS/autoregressive/full512 qualification remain unrun in this probe; prior8/512 reply evidence keeps its scope. No geometric advantage, useful conversation or energy claim. The next saved-transition-credit/action-boundary task begins only after actual protected delivery; no unchanged gradient/dose/selector repeat. Queue compatibility acknowledgements execute no tests.\n\nReferences #820\n",
